      ^{:line 341} numLMS)))













^{:go/end 431} (go/func induceSubL_8_32 "induceSubL_8_32 inserts the L-type text indexes of LMS-substrings\ninto sa, assuming that the final characters of the LMS-substrings\nare already inserted into sa, sorted by final character, and at the\nright (not left) end of the corresponding character bucket.\nEach LMS-substring has the form (as a regexp) /S+L+S/:\none or more S-type, one or more L-type, final S-type.\ninduceSubL_8_32 leaves behind only the leftmost L-type text\nindex for each LMS-substring. That is, it removes the final S-type\nindexes that are present on entry, and it inserts but then removes\nthe interior L-type indexes too.\n(Only the leftmost L-type index is needed by induceSubS_8_32.)\n" [^{:tag (slice byte)} text ^{:tag (slice int32)} sa ^{:tag (slice int32)} freq ^{:tag (slice int32)} bucket]
